OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785880112
OL,3,CTwo deaths linked to 'explosive
OL,4,Cdiarrhoea' outbreak in US, officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FTwo people have died in the US amid an
OL,8,Foutbreak of cyclospora, a parasite
OL,9,Fknown to cause "explosive diarrhoea".
OL,11,FMichigan health officials announced
OL,12,Fthe deaths on Monday, which are the
OL,13,Ffirst confirmed in the US linked to
OL,14,Fthe outbreak of the microscopic
OL,15,Fparasite.
OL,17,FThe two people who died had underlying
OL,18,Fhealth conditions that may have been
OL,19,Fworsened by the intestinal illness and
OL,20,Fdehydration, the Michigan Department
OL,21,Fof Health and Human Services said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785880112
OL,3,CTwo deaths linked to 'explosive
OL,4,Cdiarrhoea' outbreak in US, officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FThe department said it would not
OL,8,Fprovide additional information about
OL,9,Fthe deaths.
OL,11,FCyclospora is a microscopic, spherical
OL,12,Fparasite that commonly causes watery
OL,13,Fdiarrhoea "with frequent and sometimes
OL,14,Fexplosive bowel movements", according
OL,15,Fto the Centers for Disease Control
OL,16,F(CDC). Outbreaks tend to occur most
OL,17,Foften in the late spring and summer.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785880112
OL,3,CTwo deaths linked to 'explosive
OL,4,Cdiarrhoea' outbreak in US, officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FThe CDC says the illness, called
OL,8,Fcyclosporiasis, is rarely deadly. The
OL,9,Fheat-loving parasite infects the
OL,10,Fbowels and spreads through faeces.
OL,12,FPeople have previously been infected
OL,13,Fby consuming fruits or vegetables
OL,14,Fexposed to faeces-contaminated
OL,15,Firrigation water.
OL,17,FThe CDC said it is aware of more than
OL,18,F18,000 confirmed or suspected cases in
OL,19,Fthe current surge. But CDC numbers can
OL,20,Flag state reports, which suggest the
OL,21,Fnumber is more than 20,000 nationwide.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785880112
OL,3,CTwo deaths linked to 'explosive
OL,4,Cdiarrhoea' outbreak in US, officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FLettuce from Mexico served at Taco
OL,8,FBell locations in nine states has been
OL,9,Fidentified as a potential source of
OL,10,Fthe outbreak, though the CDC and the
OL,11,FFood and Drug Administration (FDA) are
OL,12,Fcontinuing to investigate.
OL,14,FUS fast-food chain Taco Bell has
OL,15,Freportedly removed the affected
OL,16,Flettuce from its restaurants.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785880112
OL,3,CTwo deaths linked to 'explosive
OL,4,Cdiarrhoea' outbreak in US, officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FIts original supplier, Taylor Farms,
OL,8,Fsays it "voluntarily recalled all
OL,9,Ficeberg lettuce grown in central
OL,10,FMexico that was identified as the
OL,11,Fpotential source of one of the recent
OL,12,FCyclospora outbreaks", adding that
OL,13,F"anything currently on shelves is not
OL,14,Fthe affected product."
OL,16,FAs of late July, the number of cases
OL,17,Flinked to the lettuce was 1,947,
OL,18,Fincluding at least 98 people who were
OL,19,Fhospitalised, according to the CDC.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785880112
OL,3,CTwo deaths linked to 'explosive
OL,4,Cdiarrhoea' outbreak in US, officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FThe agency has said other "brands,
OL,8,Frestaurants, retailers, or
OL,9,Fdistribution channels" could be tied
OL,10,Fto the outbreak as the investigation
OL,11,Fcontinues.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785880112
OL,3,CTwo deaths linked to 'explosive
OL,4,Cdiarrhoea' outbreak in US, officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FDr Joel Kammeyer, the division chief
OL,8,Fof infectious diseases at Wayne State
OL,9,FUniversity and the Detroit Medical
OL,10,FCentre, called the deaths a "tragedy"
OL,11,Fbut noted that despite thousands of
OL,12,Fcyclosporiasis cases, only two people
OL,13,Fhave died.
OL,15,F"For someone who comes into an urgent
OL,16,Fcare and cyclosporiasis is their only
OL,17,Fissue, it's relatively easy to treat,"
OL,18,FKammeyer said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785880112
OL,3,CTwo deaths linked to 'explosive
OL,4,Cdiarrhoea' outbreak in US, officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FBut for people who are struggling with
OL,8,Fother illnesses, he said: "It stands
OL,9,Fto reason that there are some patients
OL,10,Fthat might not be able to withstand
OL,11,Fthe dehydration that can come with
OL,12,Fsevere cyclosporiasis."
OL,14,FCyclosporiasis is less common than
OL,15,Fother foodborne illnesses, including
OL,16,Fsalmonella and E. coli.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785880112
OL,3,CTwo deaths linked to 'explosive
OL,4,Cdiarrhoea' outbreak in US, officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FMany cases are never linked to a
OL,8,Fspecific food or other source and, for
OL,9,Fyears, few US cyclospora outbreaks
OL,10,Fwere reported. But the number began
OL,11,Frising about a decade ago, with a
OL,12,Fparticularly notable spike in 2018 and
OL,13,F2019.
OL,15,FIn 2019, 4,700 cyclosporiasis cases
OL,16,Fwere reported in the US.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785880112
OL,3,CTwo deaths linked to 'explosive
OL,4,Cdiarrhoea' outbreak in US, officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FAccording to the NHS, cyclospora is
OL,8,Fnot found in the UK, but there is a
OL,9,Frisk of picking it up while travelling
OL,10,Fto places where it is common, such as
OL,11,FCentral and South America, south and
OL,12,Fsouth-east Asia, the Middle East and
OL,13,FAfrica.
OL,15,FPeople heading to Mexico from the UK
OL,16,Fhave been warned to take extra
OL,17,Fprecautions amid a sharp rise in cases
OL,18,Fof travellers picking up the parasite.
OL,20,FITV News has contacted Taco Bell for
OL,21,Fcomment.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
